---
banner: /assets/img/photos/banner-dates-and-events.jpg
title: Dates & Events
lede: Services, feasts, and parish gatherings for the year ahead.
description: Calendar of services, feasts, and parish events at Saint Elizabeth Orthodox Church in Poulsbo.
---

<p>Everything on the parish calendar for the coming year, month by month. For the pattern of a normal week, see our <a href="/what-we-do/worship/">regular weekly schedule</a>.</p>

{% if not calendar.configured %}
  <div class="notice">
    <strong>The parish calendar is not connected yet.</strong>
    Add the parish Google Calendar's ID to <code>googleCalendarId</code> in
    <code>src/_data/site.json</code> and this page will fill itself in. See
    <code>docs/calendar-setup.md</code> for step-by-step instructions.
  </div>
{% elif calendar.error %}
  <div class="notice">
    <strong>We could not load the calendar just now.</strong>
    Please check back shortly, or call the parish at
    <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a>.
  </div>
{% elif not calendar.months.length %}
  <p>There are no events on the parish calendar for the coming year yet.</p>
{% else %}
  {% if calendar.embedUrl %}
    <div class="calendar-embed">
      <iframe
        src="{{ calendar.embedUrl }}"
        title="Saint Elizabeth Orthodox Church parish calendar"
        loading="lazy"
        referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe>
    </div>
  {% endif %}

  <nav class="month-jump" aria-label="Jump to a month">
    {% for month in calendar.months %}
      <a href="#{{ month.key }}">{{ month.label }}</a>
    {% endfor %}
  </nav>

  {% for month in calendar.months %}
    <section class="calendar-month">
      <h2 id="{{ month.key }}" class="calendar-month-title">{{ month.label }}</h2>
      <ul class="calendar">
        {% for item in month.events %}
          <li>
            <time datetime="{{ item.date }}">{{ item.date | feastDate }}</time>
            <span>
              {{ item.title }}
              {% if not item.allDay %}<span class="calendar-meta">{{ item.start | eventTime }}</span>{% endif %}
              {% if item.location %}<span class="calendar-meta">{{ item.location }}</span>{% endif %}
            </span>
            {% if item.kind %}<span class="tag tag-{{ item.kind }}">{{ item.kind }}</span>{% endif %}
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </section>
  {% endfor %}

  <p class="small">
    Times are {{ site.address.city }} local time. The calendar is maintained in Google Calendar; this
    page updates on the next site build.
  </p>
{% endif %}

